<title>HONG KONG: Nichimen HK sets 500 mln yen step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Nichimen HK sets 500 mln yen step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following step-up callable bond issue was announced by sole arranger DKB Asia.</p>
<p>BORROWER  NICHIMEN HONG KONG (CAYMAN) LTD</p>
<p> AMOUNT    500 MLN YEN  COUPON    STEP-UP*  MATURITY  12.OCT.99</p>
<p> TYPE	EURO-YEN     ISS PRICE  100.30   LAUNCH    02.OCT.96</p>
<p> PUTS	--	     CALLS	***	DENOMS    YEN 10 MLN</p>
<p> LISTING   HONGKONG     REPAYMENT  BULLET   FULL FEES 30BP</p>
<p> RATING    NIS A	  SALES LMTS US, UK, HK, JAPAN</p>
<p> NEG PLG   YES	    CRS DEF    YES	FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW   ENGLISH	HOME CTRY  JAPAN    TAX PROV  STANDARD</p>
<p>PAY DATE  09.OCT.96</p>
<p> NOTES     *COUPON 1.25 PCT SEMIANNUAL 09.OCT.96-08.OCT.96</p>
<p>		COUPON 1.85 PCT SEMIANNUAL 09.OCT.97-O8.OCT.98</p>
<p>		COUPON 2.35 PCT SEMIANNUAL 09.OCT.98-12.OCT.99**</p>
<p>	     **LONG LAST COUPON</p>
<p>	     ***CALLABLE ON EVERY INTEREST PAYMENT DATE STARTING</p>
<p>		  FROM APRIL 9, 1997 (EVERY SIX MONTHS)</p>
<p>	     *** THE ISSUE HAS A KEEPWELL AGREEMENT FROM NICHIMEN</p>
<p>		   CORP. IT IS ISSUED UNDER THE BORROWER'S US$300</p>
<p>		   MILLION ASIAN MEDIUM-TERM NOTE PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6960</p>
</text>
